   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="instructionsLabel">
     <property name="text">
      <string>Image paths are shown relative to the common image root; paths outside it are marked. Select a path in the list. Green path segments exist; red segments are missing. Click a segment to choose its replacement file or folder; the rest of the path is kept when replacing a folder. Use config path to set the selected path's base to the folder containing this project. Undo reverses the current edit. OK applies relinking; Cancel discards it.</string>
